questions.q:
What color is the paragraph text?

p { color: red; }
p { color: blue; }

What is the total rendered width of the box (default box-sizing)?

.box {
  width: 200px;
  padding: 20px;
  border: 5px solid black;
}

What color is the text of this paragraph?

/* CSS */
.a { color: red; }
#b { color: blue; }

<!-- HTML -->
<p id="b" class="a" style="color: green">Hi</p>

What color is the paragraph text?

/* CSS */
.note { color: red !important; }
#intro { color: blue; }

<!-- HTML -->
<p id="intro" class="note">Hello</p>

The root font-size is 16px. What is the computed font-size of .child?

.parent { font-size: 1.5em; }
.child  { font-size: 1.5em; }

<div class="parent"><p class="child">Text</p></div>

What color is the heading text?

@layer reset {
  #title { color: red; }
}
h1 { color: blue; }

<h1 id="title">Hi</h1>

